{
  "audio": "027.even-with-verification.mp3",
  "paragraph": 27,
  "text": "Even with verification and sandboxes, agents can still enter doom loops, applying the same broken patch twelve times while quietly burning through API credits. That is why every production harness includes deterministic stop conditions and loop breakers. Enforce hard caps on turn counts and dollar spend, track repeated identical test or tool failures, and trip a circuit breaker the moment the agent stops making real progress. Instead of spinning forever, the harness halts cleanly and escalates to a human with a concise diagnosis of what failed and why.",
